    Include the exact commit used; the preserved version 0.1 reports and
    numerical snapshots must be identified separately when cited.
    Project initiator and maintainer: Shota Moriwaki. ChatGPT-assisted analysis;
    not peer reviewed. Cite the underlying observations, catalogues and models
    separately where used.
